{"id":508,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"育徳の校訓で夢を支える6年一貫","feature_description":"育徳館中学校は、校訓『育徳 さわやかに 心ゆたかに ひたむきに』のもと、6年間を見通した進路指導で一人ひとりの夢を実現する学校です。確かな学力の定着と個性・創造性の伸長を掲げ、部活動も運動部・文化部に分かれて多彩に展開しています。校内の学びと活動を結びながら、着実に成長できる構成です。学びの幅と学校生活の厚みを感じやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":10003,"name":"剣道部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10004,"name":"総合運動部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10005,"name":"柔道部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10006,"name":"野球部（男子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10007,"name":"陸上競技部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10008,"name":"サッカー部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10009,"name":"バスケットボール部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10010,"name":"バドミントン部（男子・女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10011,"name":"バレーボール部（女子）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10012,"name":"管弦楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10013,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://ikutoku-j.fku.ed.jp/%E9%83%A8%E6%B4%BB%E5%8B%95/","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":10014,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https: